1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,962
Alerts tell you when something you care about changes:

2
00:00:02,982 --> 00:00:04,993
a reading, a scan, or a funnel.

3
00:00:05,455 --> 00:00:08,038
Open Notifications in the sidebar.

4
00:00:08,088 --> 00:00:11,161
The Alert Feed lists every alert, newest first.

5
00:00:12,263 --> 00:00:15,080
Configure Alert Rules sets what alerts you.

6
00:00:15,130 --> 00:00:16,647
Trend alerts are on to start:

7
00:00:16,667 --> 00:00:20,572
when a reading crosses a colour border, and holds at the next close.

8
00:00:21,032 --> 00:00:22,656
Choose how alerts reach you:

9
00:00:22,676 --> 00:00:26,559
instant emails, a daily summary at your chosen hour, or both.

10
00:00:27,026 --> 00:00:31,998
Phone and desktop notifications can pop up too. Turn them on for each device.

11
00:00:32,444 --> 00:00:35,475
Then tick that step on the getting-started checklist.

12
00:00:36,643 --> 00:00:39,849
Your Prism scans and funnels have their own alert settings,

13
00:00:39,869 --> 00:00:41,700
right on the scan or funnel.
